{
  "id": 8834325414087,
  "title": "Personalized Basketball Fire and Water Splash Blanket with Name and Number",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-fire-and-water-splash-blanket-with-name-and-number-b05a53f208-b05a53f208",
  "body_html": "<p>Show your love for the game with the personalized basketball blanket by Jeminise. This custom blanket features a striking design with a basketball surrounded by fire and water splashes, making it a perfect functional and decorative piece for any sports enthusiast. Personalize it with a custom name and number to create a unique and meaningful gift for birthdays, holidays, or any special occasion.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this blanket with your own name and number for a truly unique look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from premium Fleece or Sherpa fabric with two polyester layers for super soft, lightweight, and consecutive warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from four convenient sizes to suit your needs: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), or X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor use, whether you are snuggling on the sofa, relaxing in bed, traveling, camping, or picnicking.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on air dry without heat to remain fluffy.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
